#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:202
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_BlackboardListsStatusChanges"
msgid ""
"The blackboard lists status changes\n"
"that may affect POKéMON in battle.$"
msgstr ""
"黑板上列出了对战中\n"
"可能会影响宝可梦的异常状态。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:206
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_ReadWhichTopic"
msgid "Which topic do you want to read?$"
msgstr "要看哪一项呢？$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:209
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_ExplainPoison"
msgid ""
"If a POKéMON is poisoned, it will\n"
"steadily lose HP.\p"
"The effects of poison remain after\n"
"a battle.\p"
"A poisoned POKéMON's HP will drop\n"
"while it is traveling.\p"
"Heal a poisoning using an ANTIDOTE.$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦中毒以后，\n"
"HP会不断减少。\p"
"对战结束后，\n"
"中毒的效果也不会消失。\p"
"中毒的宝可梦\n"
"在走路时HP也会减少。\p"
"用解毒药就能治好中毒。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:218
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_ExplainParalysis"
msgid ""
"If a POKéMON becomes paralyzed,\n"
"its SPEED drops.\p"
"It may also not be able to move while\n"
"it is in battle.\p"
"Paralysis remains after battle.\n"
"Cure it using a PARLYZ HEAL.$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦麻痹以后，\n"
"速度会下降。\p"
"在对战中，\n"
"有时还会无法行动。\p"
"对战结束后麻痹也不会消失。\n"
"用解麻药就能治好。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:226
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_ExplainSleep"
msgid ""
"If a POKéMON falls asleep, it will be\n"
"unable to attack.\p"
"A POKéMON may wake up on its own,\n"
"but if a battle ends while it is\l"
"sleeping, it will stay asleep.\p"
"Wake it up using an AWAKENING.$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦睡着以后，\n"
"就无法攻击。\p"
"宝可梦有时会自己醒来，\n"
"但如果对战结束时它还在睡，\l"
"它就会一直睡下去。\p"
"用解眠药就能叫醒它。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:234
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_ExplainBurn"
msgid ""
"A burn reduces ATTACK power, and it\n"
"steadily reduces the victim's HP.\p"
"A burn lingers after battle.\n"
"Cure a burn using a BURN HEAL.$"
msgstr ""
"灼伤会降低攻击，\n"
"还会让HP不断减少。\p"
"对战结束后灼伤也不会消失。\n"
"用灼伤药就能治好。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:240
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_ExplainFreeze"
msgid ""
"If a POKéMON is frozen, it becomes\n"
"completely helpless.\p"
"It will remain frozen after battle.\n"
"Thaw it out using an ICE HEAL.$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦冰冻以后，\n"
"就完全动弹不得了。\p"
"对战结束后冰冻也不会解除。\n"
"用解冻药就能让它解冻。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:246
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_StudentsWhoDontStudyGetQuickClaw"
msgid ""
"Students who don't study get a little\n"
"taste of my QUICK CLAW.\p"
"Whether or not you are a good student \n"
"will be evident from the way you use\l"
"this item.$"
msgstr ""
"不好好学习的学生，\n"
"我会让他们尝尝先制之爪的厉害。\p"
"你是不是好学生，\n"
"从你怎么使用这个道具\l"
"就能看得出来。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:253
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_ExplainQuickClaw"
msgid ""
"A POKéMON holding the QUICK CLAW will\n"
"occasionally speed up and get to move\l"
"before its opponent.\p"
"There are many other items that are\n"
"meant to be held by POKéMON.\p"
"Just those alone will give you many\n"
"topics to study!$"
msgstr ""
"携带先制之爪的宝可梦\n"
"有时速度会变快，\l"
"能比对手先行动。\p"
"还有很多其他道具\n"
"是专门给宝可梦携带的。\p"
"光是这些就够你\n"
"研究好多课题了！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:262
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_TradingRightNow"
msgid ""
"I'm trading POKéMON with my friend\n"
"right now.$"
msgstr ""
"我现在正在和朋友\n"
"交换宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:266
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_AlwaysWantedSeedot"
msgid ""
"I always wanted a SEEDOT, and\n"
"I'm finally getting one!$"
msgstr ""
"我一直都很想要橡实果，\n"
"终于要得到了！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:270
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_PokemontCantUseManMadeItems"
msgid ""
"POKéMON can hold items, but they\n"
"don't know what to do with man-made\l"
"items like POTION and ANTIDOTE.$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦虽然能携带道具，\n"
"但它们不知道该怎么使用\l"
"伤药和解毒药这样的人造道具。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:275
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_ConfusedPokemonAttacksItself"
msgid ""
"You know how some POKéMON moves can\n"
"confuse a POKéMON?\p"
"A confused POKéMON will sometimes\n"
"attack itself without meaning to.\p"
"But once it leaves battle, it will\n"
"return to normal.$"
msgstr ""
"你知道有些宝可梦的招式\n"
"能让宝可梦混乱吧？\p"
"混乱的宝可梦有时会\n"
"不由自主地攻击自己。\p"
"不过，只要离开对战，\n"
"它就会恢复正常。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:283
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_PokemonHealItselfWithBerry"
msgid ""
"A POKéMON holding a BERRY will heal\n"
"itself…\p"
"There are many kinds of items that\n"
"POKéMON can hold…\p"
"Boy, it sure is hard taking notes\n"
"down…$"
msgstr ""
"携带树果的宝可梦\n"
"会自己回复……\p"
"宝可梦能携带的道具\n"
"有很多种……\p"
"唉，记笔记\n"
"可真辛苦啊……$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:291
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_StudentsNotes"
msgid ""
"It's this student's notebook…\p"
"POKéMON are to be caught using\n"
"POKé BALLS.\p"
"Up to six POKéMON can accompany\n"
"a TRAINER.\p"
"A TRAINER is someone who catches\n"
"POKéMON, raises them, and battles\l"
"with them.\p"
"A TRAINER's mission is to defeat\n"
"the strong TRAINERS who await\l"
"challengers in POKéMON GYMS.$"
msgstr ""
"这是学生的笔记本……\p"
"要用精灵球\n"
"来捉宝可梦。\p"
"一名训练家最多\n"
"可以带6只宝可梦。\p"
"训练家就是捉宝可梦、\n"
"培养宝可梦，并和宝可梦\l"
"一起对战的人。\p"
"训练家的使命，就是打败\n"
"在宝可梦道馆等待挑战者的\l"
"强大训练家。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:304
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_ScottMetAlreadyCut"
msgid ""
"Hello? Didn't we meet before?\n"
"I think back in PETALBURG CITY.\p"
"Let me introduce myself.\n"
"My name's SCOTT.\p"
"I've been traveling everywhere in\n"
"search of outstanding TRAINERS.\p"
"More specifically, I'm looking for\n"
"POKéMON battle experts.\p"
"So, what brings you to this SCHOOL?\n"
"Are you a TRAINER, too?\p"
"The first thing you should do is to\n"
"have a POKéMON learn the move CUT.\p"
"If I remember correctly, someone in\n"
"this town has CUT.$"
msgstr ""
"你好？我们是不是见过？\n"
"好像是在橙华市吧。\p"
"让我来自我介绍一下。\n"
"我叫亚希达。\p"
"我一直在各地旅行，\n"
"寻找出色的训练家。\p"
"说得更具体一点，\n"
"我在寻找宝可梦对战的高手。\p"
"那么，你来这所学校做什么？\n"
"你也是训练家吗？\p"
"你首先应该做的，\n"
"是让宝可梦学会居合斩。\p"
"如果我没记错，这个镇上\n"
"有人有居合斩。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:320
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_StudentTalentLevelUnknown"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: Hmm…\p"
"The talent levels of the students here\n"
"are unknown. The potential's there.$"
msgstr ""
"亚希达：嗯……\p"
"这里的学生们的实力\n"
"还是未知数。不过很有潜力。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:325
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_ScottStoneBadge"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: Oh, what's that?\p"
"It's a STONE BADGE, isn't it?\n"
"That's pretty impressive, I'd say.\p"
"But, you know, I would've loved to see\n"
"you in battle.\p"
"It's hard to tell what you're like as\n"
"a TRAINER from a LEAGUE BADGE.$"
msgstr ""
"亚希达：哦，那是什么？\p"
"是原石徽章吧？\n"
"我得说，这可真了不起。\p"
"不过啊，我真想亲眼看看\n"
"你对战的样子。\p"
"光凭联盟徽章，很难看出\n"
"你是个什么样的训练家。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_PokemonSchool/scripts.inc:334
msgctxt "RustboroCity_PokemonSchool_Text_ScottMetAlreadyStoneBadge"
msgid ""
"Hello? Didn't we meet before?\n"
"I think back in PETALBURG CITY.\p"
"Let me introduce myself.\n"
"My name's SCOTT.\p"
"I've been traveling everywhere in\n"
"search of outstanding TRAINERS.\p"
"More specifically, I'm looking for\n"
"POKéMON battle experts.\p"
"Oh, what's that?\n"
"It's a STONE BADGE, isn't it?\p"
"That's pretty impressive, I'd say, for\n"
"a starting TRAINER like yourself.\p"
"But, you know, I would've loved to see\n"
"you in battle.\p"
"It's hard to tell what you're like as\n"
"a TRAINER from a LEAGUE BADGE.$"
msgstr ""
"你好？我们是不是见过？\n"
"好像是在橙华市吧。\p"
"让我来自我介绍一下。\n"
"我叫亚希达。\p"
"我一直在各地旅行，\n"
"寻找出色的训练家。\p"
"说得更具体一点，\n"
"我在寻找宝可梦对战的高手。\p"
"哦，那是什么？\n"
"是原石徽章吧？\p"
"对一个新手训练家来说，\n"
"这可真了不起。\p"
"不过啊，我真想亲眼看看\n"
"你对战的样子。\p"
"光凭联盟徽章，很难看出\n"
"你是个什么样的训练家。$"
